# Task 9 Repair - iii-runtime-spine
# Generated: 2026-06-19
# Scope: repair Task 9 independent-verification blockers for Host composition order and UI runtime-mode reporting.

## Changes made

1. `project/hosts/complete-app/Host.cs`
   - Removed `ComposeProjection` as a top-level composition step.
   - Integrated projection registration inside `ComposeWorld` (World detail, tags ["world","projection"]).
   - Enforced strict top-level order: Resource -> SceneFlow -> Ecs -> World -> Command -> Ui.
   - Added explicit per-service `GD.Print` logs, including a summary line that enumerates the six top-level services.
   - Added runtime health logging in `ComposeCommand` using `IWorldOrchestration.HealthAsync`.
   - Registered a new `RuntimeStatusViewSource` in `ComposeUi` so the UI data model has a producer-side `agentRuntime.runtime` value.

2. `project/hosts/complete-app/RuntimeStatusViewSource.cs` (new)
   - Implements `FantaSim.App.Ui.IViewSource`.
   - Builds a `RuntimeSurfaceDocument` whose `agentRuntime.runtime` field is populated from the real `IWorldOrchestration.HealthAsync` result.
   - No visual/layout changes; it only supplies the data model.

3. `project/plugins/App.Ui.Seam/ViewRenderer.cs`
   - Unchanged in this repair. The fallback text remains "local in-process orchestration", which is truthful and now superseded by the active runtime-status view source.

4. `project/hosts/complete-app/complete-app.csproj`, `project/plugins/App.Common/Bootstrap.cs`
   - Unchanged in this repair (already contained required project refs and SharedAssemblyPolicy prefixes).

